        {
          "id": 3044314792,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "It doesn't need to be, because the Fusion style already has QStyle::SH_MessageBox_TextInteractionFlags including Qt::TextSelectableByMouse so it would have no effect. It would make it look more parallel.\n\nI do it in the other place because it is possible for a user to manually set the style on Linux or macOS to one of the Windows styles or another style that doesn't allow the text selection in QMessageBox.",
